  "_comment": "Corpora the playground terminal indexes on demand (`index <name>`). Built by tools/build_corpus.py, which fills `stats`; the archives (corpus-<name>.tar.gz) are ignored by git and produced by the Pages workflow. Queries use the playground's query JSON.",
